  "notes": "M4250 series common platform: 16K MAC addresses, 4K ARP/NDP entries, 4K VLANs, static routes (894 IPv4 / 126 IPv6) plus RIP (32 IPv4), DHCP server (2K leases), sFlow, SNMP, console/telnet/SSH CLI and the AV web GUI. Rewritten from a two-line record that carried the 125 W budget but no per-port PoE, no fabric figure and no source. The cheapest 1U member: 1G SFP uplinks only, and the same 8 PoE+ / 2 copper census as the other 10-port models with a smaller supply (125 W against 240 W on the SFP+ M4250-10G2XF-PoE+). Sources: datasheet https://www.downloads.netgear.com/files/GDC/M4250/M4250_Datasheet.pdf and https://kb.netgear.com/000064904/NETGEAR-AV-Line-of-Fully-Managed-Switches-M4250-Series."
